ur cloud coding agent subscription. Keep the project.\",\"category\":\"Guides\",\"subtitle\":\"Lovable, Replit, Cursor Cloud, Devin, Factory — every one of them syncs to GitHub. That is the door out of the $600–$2,400/yr plan.\",\"date\":\"Jul 7, 2026\",\"read\":\"7 min\"},{\"slug\":\"free-alternative-to-cursor-cloud\",\"title\":\"The free alternative to Cursor Cloud\",\"category\":\"Comparisons\",\"subtitle\":\"Cursor’s background agent is great — and ~$720/yr at the tier that unlocks it. Freebuff Cloud does the cloud-sandbox-and-preview part for $0.\",\"date\":\"Jul 6, 2026\",\"read\":\"7 min\"},{\"slug\":\"free-alternative-to-claude-code-cloud\",\"title\":\"The free alternative to Claude Code Cloud\",\"category\":\"Comparisons\",\"subtitle\":\"Anthropic is putting Claude Code in the cloud. The tier that gets you there is ~$200/mo. Freebuff Cloud runs a coding agent in a cloud sandbox for $0.\",\"date\":\"Jul 5, 2026\",\"read\":\"7 min\"},{\"slug\":\"free-cloud-alternative-to-lovable\",\"title\":\"The free cloud alternative to Lovable\",\"category\":\"Comparisons\",\"subtitle\":\"Lovable got you started. Now it wants $50/mo to keep going. Point Freebuff Cloud at the same GitHub repo and continue for $0.\",\"date\":\"Jul 4, 2026\",\"read\":\"6 min\"},{\"slug\":\"free-cloud-alternative-to-devin\",\"title\":\"The free cloud alternative to Devin\",\"category\":\"Comparisons\",\"subtitle\":\"Devin pioneered the autonomous cloud engineer — at ~$2,400/yr. Freebuff Cloud covers the cloud-sandbox-and-agent part for $0.\",\"date\":\"Jul 3, 2026\",\"read\":\"7 min\"},{\"slug\":\"free-alternative-to-factory\",\"title\":\"The free alternative to Factory\",\"category\":\"Comparisons\",\"subtitle\":\"Factory sells autonomous \\\"Droids\\\" that work on your repo — ~$100/mo at the useful tier. Freebuff Cloud runs a cloud agent on any repo for $0.\",\"date\":\"Jul 2, 2026\",\"read\":\"6 min\"},{\"slug\":\"free-cloud-alternative-to-replit\",\"title\":\"The free cloud alternative to Replit\",\"category\":\"Comparisons\",\"subtitle\":\"Replit Agent is a slick cloud sandbox — and ~$90/mo at the tier that unlocks it. Freebuff Cloud runs a cloud agent on any repo for $0.\",\"date\":\"Jul 1, 2026\",\"read\":\"6 min\"},{\"slug\":\"free-pi-coding-agent-cli-alternative-freebuff\",\"title\":\"The free alternative to Pi Coding Agent\",\"category\":\"Comparisons\",\"subtitle\":\"Same CLI agent loop — without the ~$20/mo in API tokens (BYOK) bill.\",\"date\":\"Jun 24, 2026\",\"read\":\"7 min\"},{\"slug\":\"free-github-copilot-cli-coding-agent-alternative-freebuff\",\"title\":\"The free alternative to GitHub Copilot CLI\",\"category\":\"Comparisons\",\"subtitle\":\"Same CLI agent loop — without the $39/mo (Copilot Pro+) bill.\",\"date\":\"Jun 24, 2026\",\"read\":\"7 min\"},{\"slug\":\"free-anything-com-ai-app-builder-alternative-freebuff\",\"title\":\"The free alternative to Anything\",\"category\":\"Comparisons\",\"subtitle\":\"Same prompt-to-deployed-app loop — without the $24/mo (Pro, monthly billing) bill.\",\"date\":\"Jun 24, 2026\",\"read\":\"7 min\"},{\"slug\":\"free-aura-build-ai-website-builder-alternative-freebuff\",\"title\":\"The free alternative to Aura\",\"category\":\"Comparisons\",\"subtitle\":\"Same prompt-to-deployed-app loop — without the $50/mo (Max) bill.\",\"date\":\"Jun 24, 2026\",\"read\":\"7 min\"},{\"slug\":\"free-canva-code-ai-app-builder-alternative-freebuff\",\"title\":\"The free alternative to Canva Code\",\"category\":\"Comparisons\",\"subtitle\":\"Same prompt-to-deployed-app loop — without the $21/mo (Business, annual) bill.\",\"date\":\"Jun 24, 2026\",\"read\":\"7 min\"},{\"slug\":\"free-cosmic-new-ai-app-builder-alternative-freebuff\",\"title\":\"The free alternative to Cosmic.new\",\"category\":\"Comparisons\",\"subtitle\":\"Same prompt-to-deployed-app loop — without the $29.99/mo (Pro) bill.\",\"date\":\"Jun 24, 2026\",\"read\":\"7 min\"},{\"slug\":\"free-figma-make-ai-app-builder-alternative-freebuff\",\"title\":\"The f